@h3 t2va 16:9
style: live-action aerial cinematography, photorealistic, one continuous unbroken ten-second shot of smooth gimbal-stabilised drone footage
$land = __world/landscapes__
$sky = __world/weather__
$move = __drone/moves__

SHOT 10s | $move.shot
Over $land, in $sky, the drone $move. The scale reads from small things in the frame: a road, a boat, a single tree, a figure standing still. The light moves across the land as the drone flies.
SFX: $land.sfx; $sky.sfx
